2026-10-27T11:27:54.4453371Z [36;1mset_env_var_if_provided "TRIVY_SEVERITY" "$INPUT_SEVERITY" "UNKNOWN,LOW,MEDIUM,HIGH,CRITICAL"[0m
2026-10-27T11:27:54.4453674Z [36;1mset_env_var_if_provided "TRIVY_FORMAT" "$INPUT_FORMAT" "table"[0m
2026-10-27T11:27:54.4453923Z [36;1mset_env_var_if_provided "TRIVY_TEMPLATE" "$INPUT_TEMPLATE" ""[0m
2026-10-27T11:27:54.4454164Z [36;1mset_env_var_if_provided "TRIVY_OUTPUT" "$INPUT_OUTPUT" ""[0m
