2026-10-27T11:27:54.4455166Z [36;1mset_env_var_if_provided "TRIVY_IGNORE_POLICY" "$INPUT_IGNORE_POLICY" ""[0m
2026-10-27T11:27:54.4455429Z [36;1mset_env_var_if_provided "TRIVY_QUIET" "$INPUT_HIDE_PROGRESS" ""[0m
2026-10-27T11:27:54.4455696Z [36;1mset_env_var_if_provided "TRIVY_LIST_ALL_PKGS" "$INPUT_LIST_ALL_PKGS" "false"[0m
